        "base": "https://www.n4l.co.nz/feed/",
        "language": null,
        "type": "text/html",
        "value": "<div class=\"et_pb_section et_pb_section_4 et_pb_with_background et_section_regular\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_row et_pb_row_4\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_column et_pb_column_4_4 et_pb_column_4  et_pb_css_mix_blend_mode_passthrough et-last-child\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_module et_pb_text et_pb_text_4  et_pb_text_align_left et_pb_bg_layout_light\">\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"et_pb_text_inner\"><p>We\u2019d like to advise you of upcoming maintenance activities we\u2019re undertaking on the N4L systems.</p>\n<p>This work will run <strong>between 10am &#8211; 4pm on Friday 17 July</strong>.</p>\n<p>Everything should continue working as normal, and no action is needed.</p>\n<p>However, if you do notice something isn\u2019t working as expected, like an app or website isn\u2019t accessible on your network, please contact our Customer Service team on 0800 532 764 between 8am \u2013 5pm Monday to Friday.</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"></span></p></div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t</div>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz/inform-internal-maintenance-activities/\">Inform: Internal maintenance activities</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.n4l.co.nz\">Network for Learning | N4L</a>.</p>"
      }
